def get_client_id_issued_card_in_1994_3_3(cards):
    filtered_cards = cards[(cards['issued'].dt.year == 1994) & (cards['issued'].dt.month == 3) & (cards['issued'].dt.day == 3)]
    return filtered_cards['client_id'].unique()
```

