def count_accounts_opened_in_litomerice_1996(accounts_df, district_df):
    litomerice_district = district_df[district_df['A2'] == 'Litomerice'].index[0]
    accounts_litomerice_1996 = accounts_df[(accounts_df['district_id'] == litomerice_district) & (accounts_df['date'].dt.year == 1996)]
    return len(accounts_litomerice_1996)
```

