def find_account_opened_district(gender='F', birth_date='1976-01-29'):
    female_clients = client[(client['gender'] == gender) & (client['birth_date'] == birth_date)]
    accounts_opened_by_females = account[account['client_id'].isin(female_clients['client_id'])]
    return accounts_opened_by_females['district_id'].unique()
```

